    - target: {fileID: 2176869272599355111, guid: 8c60ec10e6d0341438d05d6c6b5e6119, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'I have been searching for information about the government''s involvement
        in "Project REBIRTH". I have not found a single clue. This whole city has
        been picked clean.


        However, It seems the government has come through
        here. I saw some military personnel transporting a prisoner towards the hospital.
        From what I heard, the prisoner has information regarding the location of
        the cure.


        I wanted to help the prisoner, but there were at least
        five soldiers armed with machine guns. I wouldn''t stand a chance. I will
        try to clear a path to the hospital and follow them once the coast is clear.


        -
        Trevor

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
