    - target: {fileID: 2176869272599355111, guid: 8c60ec10e6d0341438d05d6c6b5e6119, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "I hav found more information. The government plans on destroying the
        cure. They had no intention of saving humanity. I overheard one of the soldiers
        revealing the cure's location from the prisoner they were transporting. \n\nThe
        cure is at the Military Quarantine Zone, past the hospital. Unfortunately,
        I was attacked by a horde of zombies and I do not think I will survive.\n\nI
        locked the hospital door to prevent more zombies from breaking through. 
        I hid the key in a dumpster by an alleyway, between the hospital and the
        store. \n\nUse the key to get into the hospital and head towards the Military
        Quarantine Zone. I wish I could provide more assistance for whoever is reading
        this, but it seems this is as far as I will go.\n\nGo and retrieve the cure.   
        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t- Trevor"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
